# mandate-chain-attenuation — attenuation composes pairwise along the acyclic
# principal chain and needs no separate rule (§6): each link narrows, so the
# three-hop chain is well-formed and every mandate projects.
actor board mandate {deploy,procure,rollback}
actor lead on-behalf-of board mandate {deploy,rollback}
actor agent on-behalf-of lead mandate deploy
gate g risk low grant board[deploy:low] lead[deploy:low] agent[deploy:low]
cord g -> master
